ent-1363386559","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1645","id":1363386559,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85RQ6C_","user":{"login":"swinslow","id":678569,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3ODU2OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/678569?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow","html_url":"https://github.com/swinslow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2022-12-22T22:00:17Z","updated_at":"2022-12-22T22:00:17Z","body":"+1 to add; despite the attribution clause, this is still a FOSS license and has widespread use based on inclusion in Fedora.\r\n\r\nAs far as name and identifier, I'm not entirely convinced on calling it \"BSD-4-Clause-Attribution\". For \"BSD-3-Clause-Attribution\", it looks like that was BSD-3-Clause plus an attribution clause. This appears to be BSD-4-Clause, plus attribution and _minus_ the \"no endorsement\" 4th clause.\r\n\r\nMaybe `BSD-Advertising-Acknowledgment`?\r\n\r\nAlso a reminder to the general public, please stop drafting new BSD-style licenses  ;-)","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1363386559/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1371740896","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1645#issuecomment-1371740896","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1645","id":1371740896,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85Rwxrg","user":{"login":"Pizza-Ria","id":46799628,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2Nzk5NjI4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46799628?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pizza-Ria","html_url":"https://github.com/Pizza-Ria","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pizza-Ria/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pizza-Ria/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pizza-Ria/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pizza-Ria/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pizza-Ria/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pizza-Ria/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pizza-Ria/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pizza-Ria/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pizza-Ria/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-01-05T03:22:10Z","updated_at":"2023-01-05T03:22:10Z","body":"Definite +1 on @swinslow's reminder to the general public although this seems to be a few years old so, hopefully, this is not a continuing issue. I'm OK with @swinslow's suggested name.  I assume this language would be excised \"Based on the the Java version: Andrew Khan Copyright (c) 2000.\" I'm assuming this is in reference to the code rather than the license.  Otherwise +1 to add.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1371740896/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"