te for this one!","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1372442669/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1427158611","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1645#issuecomment-1427158611","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1645","id":1427158611,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85VELZT","user":{"login":"swinslow","id":678569,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3ODU2OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/678569?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow","html_url":"https://github.com/swinslow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-02-12T23:09:48Z","updated_at":"2023-02-12T23:09:48Z","body":"Ooof... so I just realized that I made a typo with different spellings for \"acknowledgment\" vs. \"acknowledgement\" (\"e\" after \"g\") for the ID vs. name in the [inclusion decision above](https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1645#issuecomment-1372442669).\r\n\r\nLooking at licenses on the existing license list, it looks like \"with the e\" is the format we've used previously: see [zlib-acknowledgement](https://spdx.org/licenses/zlib-acknowledgement.html).\r\n\r\nGiven that, since we need to resolve this (and I wouldn't particularly want to have different spellings for name vs. ID), I'm going to revise this to \"with the e\" for both, to match zlib-acknowledgement. British spelling wins, I suppose  ;)\r\n\r\nI'm going to update this issue and the PR at #1818 to fix this before merging #1818.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1427158611/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1427163225","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1645#issuecomment-1427163225","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1645","id":1427163225,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85VEMhZ","user":{"login":"swinslow","id":678569,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3ODU2OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/678569?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow","html_url":"https://github.com/swinslow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"20